('7bb7bd57-22dc-5cc3-a120-79d62781ed31','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200002','City bicycle','Hey! Selling my trusty city bike, it got me to EPFL and back all year. 7 gears, front basket, both lights and a solid rear rack. I oiled the chain in October and the tyres are fairly new. A few scratches on the frame, nothing scary. Lock not included. Happy to let you test-ride it around the block!','145','FMEL Triaudes · Ecublens','Good','Frame 54 cm · 28-inch wheels','Weekday evenings after 18:00','','/samples/city-bicycle.svg','active'),
('ad3820f7-5b78-531a-b9e0-079fff591b01','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200006','Vinyl turntable','Belt-drive turntable, 33 and 45 rpm. Works. New cartridge last spring. Dust cover included. No built-in speakers: needs an amp or active speakers. Cash or Twint.','85','FMEL Vortex · Chavannes','Very good','42 × 35 × 12 cm','Weekend pickup','','/samples/vinyl-turntable.svg','active'),
('fe3bb7e4-9cdd-5ada-b8ef-755879fc5d7e','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200003','Espresso machine','Pump espresso machine, 15 bar, 1.2 l water tank, steam wand for milk. Bought in 2023, descaled on 3 November. Comes with the portafilter, two filter baskets (single and double) and the tamper. The drip tray has a small crack at the back left corner; it still holds water. Weight 4.6 kg.','70','FMEL Ochettes · Chavannes','Good','24 × 31 × 28 cm','Flexible pickup','','/samples/espresso-machine.svg','active'),
('a8f7e93f-d940-5fb5-bb93-00d9d7bf3056','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200005','Standing floor lamp','Tall floor lamp with a cream shade, perfect for a reading corner. The light is really warm. E27 bulb included. I''m moving out at the end of the month, so it needs to go by 30 November. Merci!','30','FMEL Bourdonnette · Lausanne','Good','Height 155 cm','Pickup by 30 Nov','2026-11-30','/samples/standing-floor-lamp.svg','active'),
('801d853b-e8de-5f78-9d8a-e2480d6f140f','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200004','Full-length mirror','Full-length mirror with a wooden frame. Leans on the wall, no drilling needed. Glass is fine, no cracks. Fits in a Golf. I''m at the Learning Center most days.','35','EPFL · Ecublens','Very good','50 × 160 cm','Flexible pickup','','/samples/full-length-mirror.svg','active'),
('6794c822-970d-5781-b20b-2e37e382e451','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200001','Wooden sideboard','Solid wood sideboard with three doors. Used but sturdy. Scratches on the top. Two people to carry it. Weekend only.','120','EPFL Quartier Nord','Used','120 × 40 × 75 cm','Weekend pickup','','/samples/wooden-sideboard.svg','active'),
('2a6dd669-f65a-5d48-b85b-2c4b81b8ef9a','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200005','Potted houseplant','My monstera needs a new home! About 60 cm with its terracotta pot, and a new leaf every few weeks. Water it once a week and give it a bright spot. Dispo presque tous les soirs.','12','Ecublens · Le Croset','Good','Height around 60 cm, including pot','Flexible pickup','','/samples/potted-houseplant.svg','active'),
('599bb0cd-1779-5f6b-bb8d-57aec786aa46','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200006','Over-ear headphones','Over-ear Bluetooth headphones. About 30 h battery. Noise cancelling works. Ear pads replaced in September. USB-C cable and case included. Twint or cash.','45','FMEL Atrium · Ecublens','Very good','Adjustable headband','Weekday evenings after 18:00','','/samples/over-ear-headphones.svg','active'),
('08dc1b84-a7ea-5f58-91b4-30ac0d8fbe02','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200003','White work desk','White work desk, 120 × 60 × 75 cm, with two drawers on the right (each 38 × 40 cm). Melamine top, load capacity 40 kg. Two small marks on the left edge, otherwise no damage. The legs unscrew with the Allen key I''ll hand over, so it fits flat in an estate car. Smoke-free flat.','65','FMEL Atrium · Ecublens','Good','120 × 60 × 75 cm','Weekend pickup','','/samples/white-work-desk.svg','active'),
('06bdc0b0-6105-50cb-ba0a-455b069442a7','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200002','Rice cooker','A rice cooker is the best thing a student can own, I promise. Makes enough for 4-5 people, keeps it warm for hours, and comes with the measuring cup and the spoon. The inner pot is spotless. Selling because I''m moving back home.','20','FMEL Ochettes · Chavannes','Very good','Capacity 1.8 l · 24 × 24 × 24 cm','Weekend pickup','','/samples/rice-cooker.svg','active'),
('cab54bb9-2328-57b1-9a9d-168cd82b88e5','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200002','Two-seat sofa','Blue two-seater and honestly the comfiest spot in our flat. Removable covers (washed in October), wooden legs, one tiny stain on the back cushion you''ll never notice. It''s heavy, so bring a friend. The lift at Ochettes works. It needs to go by 6 December because my flatmate''s sofa arrives then.','180','FMEL Ochettes · Chavannes','Good','165 × 85 × 78 cm','Pickup by 6 Dec','2026-12-06','/samples/two-seat-sofa.svg','active'),
('12c9e509-68fd-551b-a2f8-492945a42e5e','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200003','24-inch monitor','24-inch IPS monitor, 1920 × 1080, 60 Hz, with HDMI and DisplayPort (both cables included). Panel 54 × 32 cm, 54 × 43 cm with the stand. No dead pixels, no scratches. The original box is gone, but I''ll wrap it properly.','90','EPFL · Ecublens','Very good','24 in · 1920 × 1080 · 54 × 32 cm','Pickup by 6 Dec','2026-12-06','/samples/monitor.svg','reserved'),
('4c7ca593-fc36-5402-b776-40e0dfbeac73','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200001','Tower fan','Free. Tower fan, 95 cm tall, 3 speeds, oscillates, remote included. A bit loud on speed 3. Ground floor.','0','FMEL Triaudes · Ecublens','Good','Height 95 cm','Weekend pickup','','/samples/tower-fan.svg','active'),
('c09d0448-e14d-5aee-a0e6-f08868e72548','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200005','Reading armchair','Fauteuil vert, très confortable! Velvet-feel fabric, no stains and no smell (I checked, promise). I read in it every evening, so the seat is soft and the back has kept its shape. It''s too big for my new room. Saturday between 10:00 and 16:00 works best.','95','FMEL Vortex · Chavannes','Very good','78 × 82 × 90 cm','Saturday 10:00-16:00','','/samples/reading-armchair.svg','active'),
('6c74b1f9-e711-575a-ab81-bfb08e908fe1','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200002','Bookshelf speakers','A pair of passive bookshelf speakers with seriously nice sound for the money! Wood-look cabinets, 2-way, 8 ohm. I used them with a small amp for two years. One has a little dent on a top corner, which you can only see if you look for it. I''m around the Unicentre during the week.','60','UNIL · Dorigny','Good','17 × 24 × 30 cm each','Weekend pickup','','/samples/bookshelf-speakers.svg','active'),
('1c67a766-26b5-5706-8ac4-acbe17242ccd','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200001','Compact study desk','Small desk. Fits a laptop and a lamp. One drawer. Light wood, some marks on the top. Ground-floor pickup.','40','FMEL Triaudes · Ecublens','Used','100 × 50 × 74 cm','Weekday evenings after 17:00','','/samples/compact-study-desk.svg','active'),
('45eb0bfa-90da-50fe-bcf7-96aa97dac950','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200005','Frying pan set','Deux poêles, 24 and 28 cm, fine for induction. The coating is still good, I cook with them every day. I''m leaving, so I''m selling both together. A wooden spatula comes with them!','12','FMEL Bourdonnette · Lausanne','Good','Ø 24 cm and 28 cm','Flexible pickup','','/samples/frying-pan-set.svg','active'),
('203fa23b-d6ff-5163-a897-98884e49c865','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200004','Single bed with mattress','Pine bed frame with slats and a 14 cm foam mattress. Mattress is clean and the cover is washable. Third floor, no lift. The frame comes apart; I''ll help carry. Saturday morning.','90','Lausanne · Centre','Good','90 × 200 cm','Saturday 10:00-14:00','','/samples/single-bed-frame.svg','active'),
('cd159a77-7c47-5a11-a2f3-8ad50c9dc31c','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200001','Linear algebra textbook (EPFL)','The textbook for Algèbre linéaire in BA1. Hardcover, no missing pages. Pencil notes in chapters 1-4, easy to erase. At EPFL most days.','22','EPFL · Ecublens','Good','Hardcover · 24 × 17 cm','Lunchtime, Mon-Fri','','/samples/linear-algebra-textbook.svg','active'),
('31a43c5f-05ca-514f-a589-b8dcaf906966','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200002','Skis and poles','Skis (165 cm) with bindings, plus poles. Great all-mountain fun! I took them to Les Diablerets and Verbier for three seasons. The bases have a few scratches, but I waxed them in February and the edges are still sharp. The bindings need adjusting to your boots at a ski shop.','90','FMEL Bourdonnette · Lausanne','Used, with marks','Skis 165 cm · poles 120 cm','Pickup by 30 Nov','2026-11-30','/samples/skis-and-poles.svg','reserved'),
('07e2b5d3-6b28-56d8-acda-0a061d3213d4','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200001','Desk lamp','Black desk lamp with a yellow shade and an adjustable arm. Warm LED bulb included. Works. I''m at EPFL most days, lunch break is fine.','15','EPFL · Ecublens','Very good','Height 42 cm','Lunchtime, Mon-Fri','','/samples/desk-lamp.svg','active'),
('75f0b1e8-cebf-5a66-99a0-f7581785a35e','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200003','Open bookshelf','Open wooden bookshelf, 80 × 30 × 180 cm, four shelves with 36 cm clearance each, so A4 folders fit. Each shelf holds about 15 kg. Visible scratches on the left side, and one shelf has a ring from a mug. Already unscrewed and flat for the car; the longest part is 180 cm.','55','EPFL Quartier Nord','Used','80 × 30 × 180 cm','Weekend pickup','','/samples/open-bookshelf.svg','active'),
('4a7bfabf-fe00-5ca9-b2f2-6d00ec23b5d3','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200001','Electric kettle','Kettle, 1.7 l. Used for one semester, like new. Auto shut-off works.','8','FMEL Atrium · Ecublens','Like new','1.7 l · 2200 W','Weekday evenings after 18:00','','/samples/electric-kettle.svg','active'),
('0572a21e-17dd-5269-b32e-22f3cdb534ec','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200004','Dining chair','One wooden dining chair. Stable. The red seat pad comes off. Three more available if you want a set.','25','FMEL Bourdonnette · Lausanne','Good','45 × 48 × 82 cm','Flexible pickup','','/samples/dining-chair.svg','active'),
('e2562b99-42d3-5f6c-a952-d1a445752e5f','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200005','Plates and mugs','À donner! Eight plates and four mugs, all slightly different, none chipped. Take them all or just a few. Merci!','0','FMEL Vortex · Chavannes','Good','8 plates · 4 mugs','Flexible pickup','','/samples/plates-and-mugs.svg','active'),
('05bc78c5-e7d4-5f37-aa02-c505dfe6c1d6','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200006','Bike helmet','Helmet, size M (54-58 cm). Worn twice, never crashed. I bought the wrong size, sadly. Adjustable dial at the back.','15','EPFL Quartier Nord','Like new','Size M · head 54-58 cm','Weekday evenings after 18:00','','/samples/bike-helmet.svg','active'),
('9b339fed-8891-57d8-b304-3fd713b4e6ca','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200002','Home office desk','Big desk where I wrote my whole Bachelor thesis! Walnut-look top, 140 × 70 cm, black metal legs, plus a white drawer unit with three drawers. Super stable, no wobble even when I typed furiously. It comes apart in about ten minutes, tools included. Wanted: someone who''ll write their thesis on it too.','110','FMEL Atrium · Ecublens','Very good','140 × 70 × 75 cm','Weekend pickup','','/samples/home-office-desk.svg','active'),
('0c8c9cee-dc41-5435-b3a1-2790bac72244','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200003','Area rug','Low-pile rug, 160 × 230 cm, blue and red, pile height 8 mm. Vacuumed every week, never wet. It is rolled up (about 20 cm across, 170 cm long), so it fits into any car.','40','FMEL Atrium · Ecublens','Very good','160 × 230 cm','Weekend pickup','','/samples/area-rug.svg','active'),
('1fbc10fc-a868-5ba3-9d60-7c7ada98fb86','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200006','Droit des obligations notes (UNIL)','À donner. Printed and highlighted notes for Droit des obligations, 2nd year. Summary sheets inside. Take them.','0','UNIL · Dorigny','Used, with marks','Printed · about 140 pages','Flexible pickup','','/samples/law-course-notes.svg','active'),
('1ce6ff75-bdd6-511b-8ede-b9edb6789cd5','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200002','Oil-filled radiator','Winter is coming and this thing saved me from freezing last year! Oil-filled radiator, 2000 W, three heat settings plus a thermostat, on wheels so you can roll it from the desk to the bed. Warms a 15 m² room in about 20 minutes. No smell. Just don''t leave it on while you''re out, obviously.','30','Ecublens · Le Croset','Good','Height 62 cm · 2000 W','Pickup by 6 Dec','2026-12-06','/samples/fan-heater.svg','active'),
('5047439e-f62c-535a-9da3-b2c24ddc9d9c','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200003','Two-door wardrobe','Two-door wardrobe, 100 × 50 × 200 cm. Inside: one hanging rail and three shelves, each 46 cm deep. The right door has a scratch about 20 cm long at handle height, and the bottom corners show wear. The doors close properly. It comes apart into six panels, and the instructions are included.','70','UNIL · Dorigny','Used, with marks','100 × 50 × 200 cm','Pickup by 30 Nov','2026-11-30','/samples/wardrobe.svg','reserved'),
('601483c7-7db1-5f57-aaa6-9fe61c0ba85f','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200004','Tennis racket','Tennis racket, grip size 3. New grip tape last month. Strings fine. Cover included. Pickup at the UNIL sports centre.','25','UNIL · Dorigny','Good','Head 645 cm² · 27 in','Weekday evenings after 18:00','','/samples/tennis-racket.svg','active'),
('6aa20fe2-4d40-5958-aacd-b7054c4ac838','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200004','Storage shelf','White cube shelf, 2 × 4. A bit scuffed at the bottom. Heavier than it looks. A few boxes included if you want them.','35','FMEL Ochettes · Chavannes','Good','70 × 30 × 150 cm','Weekday evenings after 18:00','','/samples/storage-shelf.svg','active'),
('928a3996-86c3-54b3-9590-c8b714ae7a14','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200005','Framed prints, set of 3','Trois affiches avec cadres, 30 × 40 cm. I bought them for my room and then moved. Warm colours, perfect above a desk. The glass is clean and the hooks are included.','18','Lausanne · Centre','Like new','30 × 40 cm each','Flexible pickup','','/samples/framed-prints.svg','active'),
('d9ef629d-6eb7-5706-b921-9896c0f9fe9a','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200006','Free spare chair','À donner. Blue chair, used, a bit wobbly on one leg. Take it whenever, just message me.','0','Ecublens · Le Croset','Used','45 × 48 × 82 cm','Flexible pickup','','/samples/free-spare-chair.svg','active'),
('d7771220-fa24-5cd3-bdd9-d919effc67cb','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200004','Inkjet printer','All-in-one inkjet printer: prints, scans, copies. Wi-Fi works on a good day. Scuffed on top. Cartridges nearly empty, so buy new ones. USB cable included.','25','FMEL Vortex · Chavannes','Used, with marks','42 × 35 × 18 cm','Flexible pickup','','/samples/inkjet-printer.svg','active'),
('95af934e-c4ed-55eb-8dde-59f64f9f7b27','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200003','Vacuum cleaner','Canister vacuum cleaner, 700 W, bagless with a 1.5 l dust container. Hose 1.8 m, telescopic tube, floor and crevice nozzles included. The filter was cleaned on 10 November and the cable is 5 m long. Runs normally; the right wheel squeaks slightly.','40','FMEL Bourdonnette · Lausanne','Good','Canister · 38 × 26 × 26 cm','Flexible pickup','','/samples/vacuum-cleaner.svg','active'),
('6f198d18-8129-5baf-9d0a-a18e46c5b83d','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200005','Living room sofa','Grand canapé jaune moutarde, trois places. The cushions are firm and nothing is broken. Two people needed to carry it, no stairs.','220','FMEL Triaudes · Ecublens','Good','185 × 90 × 80 cm','Weekend pickup','','/samples/living-room-sofa.svg','reserved'),
('dce58145-98cf-5f68-8fc5-49db2a7bbc3b','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200005','Yoga mat','Tapis de yoga bleu, 6 mm thick so it''s easy on the knees. Used for a year and cleaned every week. Strap included.','10','Lausanne · Centre','Good','183 × 61 cm · 6 mm','Flexible pickup','','/samples/yoga-mat.svg','sold'),
('928b927f-7bec-5b75-86e6-efcb7be496ab','df5ead21-cb17-52ad-af2d-b6b167200001','Small reading lamp','Small table lamp with a ceramic base and a cream shade. Works.','10','FMEL Vortex · Chavannes','Used','Height 38 cm','Flexible pickup','','/samples/small-reading-lamp.svg','sold');
